# The handhelds a ZyperOS release carries, one device id a line, as
# src/device/<id>_profile.c names it. tools/release-devices.sh reads it.
#
# tools/release.sh builds, names, signs and checks each one, and publishes
# nothing until the release notes (docs/releases/v<version>.md) have a
# "Tested on <id>: <who, on what>" line for every one. The release workflow
# checks each one's image is in the release's SHA256SUMS, and the Pages
# workflow counts each one's downloads. ZyperOS Installer and zyperos.com
# offer the devices the newest release has an image for.
#
# A device is added here with its first release, never before, and stays:
# System Update and the installer read releases/latest, so a later release
# without it would leave that device with nothing to find. Each device here
# has its profile and its res/update/min-system-<id> (make
# check-release-devices).
